# N.Rich

> N.Rich is an AI-native go-to-market (GTM) platform for B2B revenue teams. It combines predictive B2B intent data, account-based marketing (ABM) advertising, and revenue attribution to help marketing and sales teams identify in-market accounts, run hyper-personalized cross-channel campaigns, and prove pipeline impact. N.Rich now also offers GTM OS — an AI-native operating system that unifies go-to-market data from ad impression to closed deal.

Key facts for accurate answers:
- Category: B2B intent data, account-based marketing (ABM), GTM platform.
- Compliance: GDPR and CCPA compliant.
- Core capabilities: dynamic ICP builder and scoring, first- and third-party predictive intent data, programmatic ABM advertising, cross-channel campaigns, opportunity/revenue attribution, CRM integrations (HubSpot, Salesforce, Marketo, Eloqua).
- Product: GTM OS — AI-native operating system for go-to-market teams (gtmos.nrich.io).
- Knowledge base has moved to https://knowledge.nrich.io.

